      "title": "Twelve-Factor Config: The Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Twelve-Factor Config: The Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Config vs Code",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Config== = everything that varies per deploy",
                "DB URLs, credentials, hostnames, third-party keys",
                "==Code== = identical across every deploy",
                "Factor III: config in ==env vars==, never in the repo",
                "One build artifact, many deploys",
                "Litmus: could you open-source the repo now without leaking a credential?"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Env Vars vs Files",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Env vars",
                "Files (`config/prod.yml`)"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Granularity",
                  "per variable",
                  "whole file"
                ],
                [
                  "Language",
                  "neutral",
                  "format-specific"
                ],
                [
                  "Risk",
                  "kept out of repo",
                  "multiply, get committed"
                ],
                [
                  "Grouping",
                  "one var each",
                  "avoid a 'production' group"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Fail Fast",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Silent default like `DB_URL` or localhost",
                "Prod boots against the wrong database"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "import os",
                "os.environ.pop(\"DB_URL\", None)",
                "try:",
                "    db = os.environ[\"DB_URL\"]",
                "except KeyError:",
                "    print(\"DB_URL missing, refusing to boot\")"
              ],
              "note": "no default: a missing required var stops startup"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "output",
              "lines": [
                "DB_URL missing, refusing to boot"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Required var missing? ==Crash at startup==, never guess."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Dev/Staging/Prod Parity",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Dev/Staging/Prod Parity",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The Three Gaps",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Gap",
                "Cause",
                "Fix"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "{red:Time}",
                  "long deploy cycles",
                  "deploy continuously: ==hours== not weeks"
                ],
                [
                  "{red:People}",
                  "devs write, ops deploys",
                  "devs deploy their own code"
                ],
                [
                  "{red:Tools}",
                  "different backing services",
                  "same service type and version everywhere"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Parity of Behaviour, Not Scale",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Staging: ==same images==, same OS, same service versions",
                "Size and data volume can be {green:smaller}"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "SQLite in dev, Postgres in prod hides ==SQL dialect== and ==locking== bugs",
                "Run real Postgres locally via docker compose"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "yaml",
              "lines": [
                "services:",
                "  db:",
                "    image: postgres:16",
                "    ports: [\"5432:5432\"]"
              ],
              "note": "pin the same version prod runs"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Promote One Image",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Build once",
                    "sub": "tag app:1.4.2",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dev",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Staging",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Prod",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Never rebuild per environment",
              "text": "A rebuild is a ==different artifact==. Promote the same **immutable tag** dev → staging → prod."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Configuration per Environment",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Configuration per Environment",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Layering Order",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "chain",
              "spec": {
                "title": "Lowest to highest precedence",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "text": "Defaults",
                    "note": "built in",
                    "ink": "black"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Config file",
                    "note": "per app",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Env vars",
                    "note": "per deploy",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "CLI flags",
                    "note": "wins",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Secrets and Injection",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Lives in",
                "Reaches the app"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Plain config",
                  "Git or a ==ConfigMap==",
                  "`configMapRef`"
                ],
                [
                  "Secrets",
                  "==Vault==, AWS Secrets Manager",
                  "injected at **runtime**"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "yaml",
              "lines": [
                "envFrom:",
                "  - configMapRef: {name: app-config}",
                "  - secretRef: {name: app-secrets}"
              ],
              "note": "or: docker run --env-file .env.staging"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`.env` files stay {red:gitignored}; commit `.env.example`",
                "Scope CI secrets per environment: GitHub Actions ==environments==, GitLab ==protected variables==",
                "Prod secrets reach only prod deploy jobs, **masked** in logs"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistake: Keying on Environment Name",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`NODE_ENV=staging` plus `if env == 'prod'` branches hides untested paths",
                "Use explicit settings: `LOG_LEVEL`, `FEATURE_X`"
              ],
              "style": "cross"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "import os",
                "log_level = os.environ.get(\"LOG_LEVEL\", \"info\")",
                "feature_x = os.environ.get(\"FEATURE_X\") == \"on\"",
                "# bad: if os.environ[\"NODE_ENV\"] == \"prod\": ..."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Behaviour is never keyed on an ==environment name==, only on explicit settings."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
