          "title": "Cheat Sheet: Config and Environments",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Config and Precedence",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Env vars== hold anything that differs per deploy",
                "**One artifact** is promoted unchanged through every environment",
                "Missing required var: {red:crash at startup}, no silent default"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Defaults",
                    "sub": "lowest",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "File",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Env var",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "CLI flag",
                    "sub": "highest",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "import os",
                "try:",
                "    db = os.environ[\"APP_DB_URL\"]",
                "except KeyError as err:",
                "    print(\"crash at startup: missing\", err)"
              ],
              "note": "required var: no default"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "output",
              "lines": [
                "crash at startup: missing 'APP_DB_URL'"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Parity and Secrets",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Same backing service **type and version**",
                "Same image in every environment",
                "Deploy continuously; devs own their deploys",
                "Secrets: ==manager== plus runtime injection, scoped per environment",
                "`.env` gitignored, `.env.example` committed"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Flags, Previews, Migrations",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Topic",
                "Rule"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Config vs flag",
                  "Config needs a **redeploy**; a flag is a runtime toggle"
                ],
                [
                  "Flag rot",
                  "Owner and expiry date per flag"
                ],
                [
                  "Preview env",
                  "Per-PR namespace, seeded data, teardown on close, TTL backup"
                ],
                [
                  "Migrations",
                  "Separate pre-deploy job, ==expand/contract=="
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Migration safety",
              "text": "Stay backward-compatible with the old code. Never make a ==destructive change== in the same release."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
